        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Brocaded in gilded tinsel, gilded silver wire wound on a silk core, gilded silver frisé yarn, and polychrome silk on a figured ground of white silk.  Undulating floral vines with symmetrical floral arrangements between them.  Composed of two pieces.  Selvedge on both sides of five cords.  Very faded, soiled, stained.  Very worn, many splits and holes."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/eabff492-4130-3ba7-832f-00dbd20f9ff2> .

